{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Paid By Blood' is a visual novel with a top-down  and fixed camera perspective, supplemented by a few battles. You will play as Scout No. 3, venturing deep into dangerous zone to uncover the path leading to Ground Zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total text volume of the game is approximately 50,000 Chinese characters (excluding punctuation marks).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most texts can be freely chosen for reading or not. Your reading progress and choices will not affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950640/extras/14a19db27daa6608e64fda6a65c0fa66.avif?t=1759291291\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950640/extras/260166a21dd13b133cbeaded8c5ffc1e.avif?t=1759291291\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950640/extras/2ce849da6f3654cedc2573daae8ef43f.avif?t=1759291291\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Average Legit Game Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950640/f18299bbafe0054867c756d5b4a42ee35d5c9a0a.jpg"},{"name":"Daily Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950640/b6698523c81a69ea02d39c64c46ab02bdd9b4fed.jpg"},{"name":"Bright","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950640/cacd256319842bf25329e93f95cf22b633f07097.jpg"},{"name":"Enterprise Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam